"同一局域网内同步纯文本剪贴板：UDP 发现 + TCP 加密会话。默认关闭；配对时两端必须显示同一个 6 位确认码。远端内容只写入剪贴板，不自动粘贴。" = "Sync plain-text clipboard over the same LAN: UDP discovery + encrypted TCP sessions. Off by default; both ends must show the same 6-digit confirmation code when pairing. Remote content is written to the clipboard only and never pasted automatically.";
