"还没有发现设备。确认两台设备在同一局域网、都已开启本开关；macOS 15+ 首次监听时会请求本地网络权限。" = "No devices found yet. Make sure both devices are on the same LAN and both have this switch enabled; macOS 15+ asks for Local Network permission on first listen.";
"一键停止" = "Stop all";
"关闭开关并释放监听端口。已配对设备仍保留信任，重新开启后可直接使用。" = "Turn the switch off and release the listening port. Paired devices keep their trust and work again when you turn it back on.";
"· 默认关闭；开启后只在局域网内通信（UDP 发现 + TCP 加密会话）。" = "· Off by default; when enabled it communicates only on the LAN (UDP discovery + encrypted TCP sessions).";
"· 配对必须由两端核对同一个 6 位数字；远端内容只写剪贴板，不自动粘贴。" = "· Pairing requires both ends to verify the same 6-digit code; remote content is written to the clipboard only and never pasted automatically.";
"· 不记录剪贴板内容，不做剪贴板历史；状态文件只存设备身份与信任表。" = "· Clipboard content is never recorded and no history is kept; the state file stores only device identity and the trust table.";
"· 首次监听时系统会请求「本地网络」权限；拒绝后功能不可用，需到系统设置里放行。" = "· On first listen the system asks for Local Network permission; if denied, the feature is unavailable until you allow it in System Settings.";
